Package: iot-agent
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Your Name <your.email@example.com>
Description: High-performance C++ IoT monitoring agent
 Lightweight monitoring agent for IoT devices that collects
 system metrics (CPU, memory, disk, network) and sends them
 to Datadog for centralized monitoring and alerting.
 .
 Features:
  - Multi-threaded architecture
  - DogStatsD and HTTP API support
  - Real-time anomaly detection
  - Sub-second metric collection
  - < 50MB RAM footprint
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libcurl4 (>= 7.68.0), libssl1.1 (>= 1.1.1)
